{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Kitchen Sabotage",
    "steam_appid": 3774230,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 4-12 players online or over local WiFi while cooking in a restaurant, but be careful as one or more random players among the chefs are Imposters determined to sabotage everyone's meal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created as a party game, we recommend playing with friends at a LAN party or online using voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774230/extras/65ccd68d1957e65d1d0ca923564a742e.avif?t=1754778159\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn by completing tasks to bring proper food to customers or by catching all the saboteurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React fast to undo the sabotage of the saboteurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report any spoiled food immediately to start discussing who the suspected Impostor is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize emergency meetings to discuss suspicious behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote to expel Suspected Imposters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774230/extras/dff6b7b94c20ad02c7cd5a9ef686b4a7.avif?t=1754778159\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spoil dishes made by chefs and blame eyewitnesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretend to perform tasks to blend in with the chefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774230/extras/676d7bbf449513e2382ce00c13a2ed5d.avif?t=1754778159\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with 4-12 players online or over local WiFi while cooking in a restaurant, but be careful as one or more random players among the chefs are Imposters determined to sabotage everyone's meal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally created as a party game, we recommend playing with friends at a LAN party or online using voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774230/extras/65ccd68d1957e65d1d0ca923564a742e.avif?t=1754778159\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn by completing tasks to bring proper food to customers or by catching all the saboteurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React fast to undo the sabotage of the saboteurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report any spoiled food immediately to start discussing who the suspected Impostor is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize emergency meetings to discuss suspicious behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote to expel Suspected Imposters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774230/extras/dff6b7b94c20ad02c7cd5a9ef686b4a7.avif?t=1754778159\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spoil dishes made by chefs and blame eyewitnesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretend to perform tasks to blend in with the chefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774230/extras/676d7bbf449513e2382ce00c13a2ed5d.avif?t=1754778159\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p>",
